{"key":"TutorialDesc.json|/dataList/71/content","kr_sha":"8a7422d013495fb91094ab0bcbd1abb67b866c3252eb00c9e4ab9634969f04bf","zh":"迷宮中存在擁有多個部位的異想體。\n當異想體擁有多個部位時，\n各個部位的抗性及其技能、被動效果均有區別。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
