{"key":"TutorialDesc.json|/dataList/73/content","kr_sha":"a1ddb33eaaf35258243bea3a394430aaea2cec74270e83340ddb960d5970de4a","zh":"然而，圖鑑現在還是未完成的狀態。\n僅憑表面觀察無法完全掌握異想體的資訊。\n您每次與異想體戰鬥，都會使圖鑑更為完善。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"TutorialDesc.json|/dataList/73/id","kr_sha":"4b72fd0b04229d533f56f849162480c2578d3e3e782356cb3f956acf777ed053","zh":"tutorial_1101_03_popup_title","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"TutorialDesc.json|/dataList/74/content","kr_sha":"ef56953c8edf5433fce0a7b12db95fbd12778a7eb576b7f1b10b562068980141","zh":"異想體圖鑑中記錄了各個部位的情報。\n最初遭遇異想體時，其圖鑑還處於未完成狀態。\n未完成的圖鑑會在與異想體的每次戰鬥中逐步完善。\n重複遭遇異想體並與之戰鬥，觀察等級也會隨之上升。\n觀察等級越高，對異想體造成的傷害越高。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"TutorialDesc.json|/dataList/74/id","kr_sha":"641861d5c376708891a1bbf13d06e9c55de538075743f07f00947276aa3d0ab1","zh":"tutorial_1101_03","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"TutorialDesc.json|/dataList/75/content","kr_sha":"082c193c6ec1341998fe04fd849e6bd615d38d491d75e2b95f0a0563a962f657","zh":"在集中遭遇戰中，時不時會出現要求做出決策的<選項>。\n這需要您一邊關注現狀一邊選擇罪人做出行動。\n根據選項結果的不同，異想體會出現不同的反應，所以請慎重做出決策。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
